00:04:46.968 --> 00:04:50.634
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:50.634 --> 00:04:53.100
-Clare?
-Mm-hmm.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.167
That's right.

00:04:55.167 --> 00:04:56.868
-Oh.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:56.868 --> 00:04:58.534
Ruth Negga, everybody!
-Oh, you're so sweet.

00:04:58.534 --> 00:04:59.634
-Whatever you're doing,
don't stop.

00:04:59.634 --> 00:05:00.834
-Thank you.

00:05:00.834 --> 00:05:03.133
-"Passing" is streaming now
on Netflix.

